"┌ Preview ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│Where each profile applies:                                                   │"
"│  here (~/code/ghpr) → personal (default)                                     │"
"│  anywhere else → personal (default)                                          │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│First match wins: --profile, git config ghpr.profile, directories (longest),  │"
"│email, then the default.                                                      │"
